{"id":"torrey:sins-national","source":"torrey","name":"Sins, National","slug":"sins-national","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Pervade all ranks — Isa 1:5; Jer 5:1-5; 6:13.","refs":[["Isa",1,5,1,5],["Jer",5,1,5,5],["Jer",6,13,6,13]]},{"text":"Often caused and encouraged by rulers — 1Ki 12:26-33; 14:16; 2Ch 21:11-13; Pr 29:12.","refs":[["1Kgs",12,26,12,33],["1Kgs",14,16,14,16],["2Chr",21,11,21,13],["Prov",29,12,29,12]]},{"text":"Often caused by prosperity — De 32:15; Ne 9:28; Jer 48:11; Eze 16:49; 28:5.","refs":[["Deut",32,15,32,15],["Neh",9,28,9,28],["Jer",48,11,48,11],["Ezek",16,49,16,49],["Ezek",28,5,28,5]]},{"text":"The land. — Le 18:25; Nu 35:33,34; Ps 106:38; Isa 24:5; Mic 2:10.","refs":[["Lev",18,25,18,25],["Num",35,33,35,33],["Num",35,34,35,34],["Ps",106,38,106,38],["Isa",24,5,24,5],["Mic",2,10,2,10]]},{"text":"The people. — Le 18:24; Eze 14:11.","refs":[["Lev",18,24,18,24],["Ezek",14,11,14,11]]},{"text":"National worship. — Isa 1:10-15; Am 5:21,22; Hag 2:14.","refs":[["Isa",1,10,1,15],["Amos",5,21,5,21],["Amos",5,22,5,22],["Hag",2,14,2,14]]},{"text":"Aggravated by privileges — Isa 5:4-7; Eze 20:11-13; Am 2:4; 3:1,2; Mt 11:21-24.","refs":[["Isa",5,4,5,7],["Ezek",20,11,20,13],["Amos",2,4,2,4],["Amos",3,1,3,1],["Amos",3,2,3,2],["Matt",11,21,11,24]]},{"text":"Lead the heathen to blaspheme — Eze 36:20,23; Ro 2:24.","refs":[["Ezek",36,20,36,20],["Ezek",36,23,36,23],["Rom",2,24,2,24]]},{"text":"Are a reproach to a people — Pr 14:34.","refs":[["Prov",14,34,14,34]]},{"text":"Repented of. — Jer 18:8; Jon 3:5.","refs":[["Jer",18,8,18,8],["Jonah",3,5,3,5]]},{"text":"Mourned over. — Joe 2:12.","refs":[["Joel",2,12,2,12]]},{"text":"Confessed. — Le 26:40; De 30:2; Jdj 10:10; 1Ki 8:47,48.","refs":[["Lev",26,40,26,40],["Deut",30,2,30,2],["Judg",10,10,10,10],["1Kgs",8,47,8,47],["1Kgs",8,48,8,48]]},{"text":"Turned from. — Isa 1:16; Ho 14:1,2; Jon 3:10.","refs":[["Isa",1,16,1,16],["Hos",14,1,14,1],["Hos",14,2,14,2],["Jonah",3,10,3,10]]},{"text":"Saints especially mourn over — Ps 119:136; Eze 9:4.","refs":[["Ps",119,136,119,136],["Ezek",9,4,9,4]]},{"text":"Mourn over. — Eze 10:6; Jer 13:17; Eze 6:11; Joe 2:17.","refs":[["Ezek",10,6,10,6],["Jer",13,17,13,17],["Ezek",6,11,6,11],["Joel",2,17,2,17]]},{"text":"Testify against. — Isa 30:8,9; 58:1; Eze 2:3-5; 22:2; Jon 1:2.","refs":[["Isa",30,8,30,8],["Isa",30,9,30,9],["Isa",58,1,58,1],["Ezek",2,3,2,5],["Ezek",22,2,22,2],["Jonah",1,2,1,2]]},{"text":"Try to turn the people from. — Jer 23:22.","refs":[["Jer",23,22,23,22]]},{"text":"Pray for forgiveness of. — Ex 32:31,32; Joe 2:17.","refs":[["Exod",32,31,32,31],["Exod",32,32,32,32],["Joel",2,17,2,17]]},{"text":"National prayer rejected on account of — Isa 1:15; 59:2.","refs":[["Isa",1,15,1,15],["Isa",59,2,59,2]]},{"text":"National worship rejected on account of — Isa 1:10-14; Jer 6:19,20; 7:9-14.","refs":[["Isa",1,10,1,14],["Jer",6,19,6,19],["Jer",6,20,6,20],["Jer",7,9,7,14]]},{"text":"Cause the withdrawal of privileges — La 2:9; Am 8:11; Mt 23:37-39.","refs":[["Lam",2,9,2,9],["Amos",8,11,8,11],["Matt",23,37,23,39]]},{"text":"Bring down national judgments — Mt 23:35,36; 27:25.","refs":[["Matt",23,35,23,35],["Matt",23,36,23,36],["Matt",27,25,27,25]]},{"text":"Denunciations against — Isa 1:24; 30:1; Jer 5:9; 6:27-30.","refs":[["Isa",1,24,1,24],["Isa",30,1,30,1],["Jer",5,9,5,9],["Jer",6,27,6,30]]},{"text":"Punishment for — Isa 3:8; Jer 12:17; 25:12; Eze 28:7-10.","refs":[["Isa",3,8,3,8],["Jer",12,17,12,17],["Jer",25,12,25,12],["Ezek",28,7,28,10]]},{"text":"Punishment for, averted on repentance — Jdj 10:15,16; 2Ch 12:6,7; Ps 106:43-46; Jon 3:10.","refs":[["Judg",10,15,10,15],["Judg",10,16,10,16],["2Chr",12,6,12,6],["2Chr",12,7,12,7],["Ps",106,43,106,46],["Jonah",3,10,3,10]]},{"text":"Sodom and Gomorrah. — Ge 18:20; 2Pe 2:6.","refs":[["Gen",18,20,18,20],["2Pet",2,6,2,6]]},{"text":"Children of Israel. — Ex 16:8; 32:31.","refs":[["Exod",16,8,16,8],["Exod",32,31,32,31]]},{"text":"Nations of Canaan. — De 9:4.","refs":[["Deut",9,4,9,4]]},{"text":"Kingdom of I